<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00124/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一把经过异常改造的███牌AK-47水弹枪，当使用项目射出水弹时，水弹会转变为7.62mm步枪弹。值得注意的是子弹在打出后是未击发的状态。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong> ███市一市民家中<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于Site-██异常武器收容室中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>无限子弹补给？</em>——Dr.pigeon</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00124" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00124" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00124-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6306406&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607416674" alt="ScorpionidaSlaughter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6306406)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;">ScorpionidaSlaughter</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1588036841 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">28 Apr 2020 01:20</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00406/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一张贴有基金会5级权限卡图片贴纸的█安█技大学的门禁卡，持有该门禁卡会导致持有者认为自己拥有5级权限，并尝试打开视野内一切使用门禁卡的门以离开当前所在设施（未必是基金会设施），如果无法打开门禁或被阻拦，持有者将加速至███km/h冲破阻拦<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/██/20<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>█安█技大学██校园正门，当时该门禁卡的持有者撞毁了该校的保安亭，在尝试登上公交车时被临时站点的基金会特工控制。经查，公交车无异常<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被放置于一个心灵遮断合金制成的盒子里<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>被封校逼疯的可怜娃儿——研究员ENC<br />
他们是怎么知道基金会的存在的？——Dr.████</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00406" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00406" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00406-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/edwardnewtchen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6273721); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6273721&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607416674" alt="EdwardNewtChen" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6273721)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/edwardnewtchen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6273721); return false;">EdwardNewtChen</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1600877322 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">23 Sep 2020 16:08</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00093/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">一个人形生物，并未认为有智能。皮肤为白色，高度约为2.38米以上，全身细长且躯干与身体比例严重失衡。当任何生物将目光注视此异常的面部或此异常的面部视频，照片时，此异常将会开始以人类声音啼哭。在1到2分钟后，其将用35千米到███千米/秒的速度冲向该个体，并且在用美式英语对该个体说“Happy April Fools' Day”之后试图回到收容所。目前看来，任何已知材料或者方法都不可能阻止其前进。</span>在2020/7/01时失去异常性质并变为无法摧毁的雕像。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/04/01<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-██的前台，此异常被当作愚人节礼物寄往基金会。已提交关于是否可将此异常纳入普通SCP列表中的申请。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>在此异常的脚踝处写有：</p>
<div class="wiki-note">
<p>make sure ur havin' fun wis dis gift!</p>
</div>
<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">收容于Site-CN-75的人形异常收容间</span>收容于Site-CN-75的低价值异常物品储存间
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;新增：2020/4/26</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;隐藏</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>此异常脚踝处的文字在当天变为：</p>
<div class="wiki-note">
<p>from: SCP財団(JP)<br />
to: SCP基金会(CN)</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;新增：2020/4/27</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;隐藏</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>此异常脚踝处的文字在当天变为：</p>
<div class="wiki-note">
<p>SCP-096, the shy guy<br />
happy April Fools' Day!</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;新增：2020/7/03</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;隐藏</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>因在2020/7/01，此异常变为无法摧毁的雕像后失去了所有异常性质，对于将此异常列为正式的SCP的申请已被驳回。</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00093" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00093" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00093-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/on-no" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5637670); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5637670&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607416674" alt="on-no" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5637670)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/on-no" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5637670); return false;">on-no</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1587287518 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">19 Apr 2020 09:11</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00421/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一本名为███新高中英语词汇的工具书，其异常表现为会使试图背诵其内单词者总是停留在第一页。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>███师范大学附属中学某班级。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>存放于Area-CN-15的低价值异常物品储藏室内。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>abandon，遗弃&#8230;&#8230;-某学生</em><br />
<em>都两个月了你为什么还在背第一页？！！-外勤特工王█<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-98060-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-98060-1')">1</a></sup></em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00421" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00421" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00421-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kaster-k" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6606914); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6606914&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607416674" alt="kaster-k" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6606914)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kaster-k" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6606914); return false;">kaster-k</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1601631302 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">02 Oct 2020 09:35</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
